title "SAP S/4HANA (Fly)"
layout reach 2 0
subtitle "On Premise Systems – One Location, Production only"

# not modelled: legend, domain colour key, "Updated" date

BC manage-tech: Manage Technology
BC erp-cap: Enterprise Resource Planning
BC manage-fin: Manage Finances
BC manage-log: Manage Logistics

BA erp: SAP S/4HANA ERP
BA finance: SAP Finance
BA tm: SAP Transportation Mgmt

SI erp-prod: SAP S/4HANA ERP Prod
SI transport-prod: SAP S/4HANA Transport Mgmt Prod
SI finance-prod: SAP Finance Prod
SI tm-prod: SAP Transportation Mgmt

BS other-services: Other related services (TBD)
BSO other-offerings: Other related offerings (TBD)
BSO finance-reporting: SAP Finance Group Reporting
BSO tm-support: SAP Transportation Mgmt Support
BS accounting: Accounting Services
BS fleet: Fleet and Logistics Services
SP tech-portfolio: Technology
SP fin-portfolio: Financial Mgmt Portfolio
SP log-portfolio: Logistics and Procurement

CI(Application) fiori: SAP Fiori Apps Odata Services
CI(Application) backend: Backend Apps ABAP
CI(Application) hana: HANA Database
CI(Infrastructure) network-gear: Network Gear (Switches/Routers)
CI(Infrastructure) front-end: Front End Server(s)
CI(Infrastructure) back-end: Back End Server(s)
CI(Infrastructure) db-servers: Database Server(s)
CI(Infrastructure) storage: Storage (Sans/NAS/Cloud)

TMSO sap-admin: SAP Administration
TMS app-mgmt: App Mgmt Services
TMSO various-offerings: Various Support/Admin Offerings TBD
TMS various-tms: Various Tech Mgmt Services TBD
DCG groups: Various Groups by Query TBD

# strategic (Provided by::Provides)
manage-tech -> app-mgmt
manage-tech -> various-tms
erp-cap -> other-services
manage-fin -> accounting
manage-log -> fleet

erp-cap -> erp
manage-fin -> finance
manage-log -> tm

# platform host
finance -> erp
tm -> erp
erp -> erp-prod
finance -> finance-prod
tm -> tm-prod

finance-prod -> erp-prod
tm-prod -> transport-prod

other-offerings -> other-services
other-offerings -> erp-prod
finance-reporting -> finance-prod
tm-support -> tm-prod
finance-reporting -> accounting
tm-support -> fleet
accounting -> fin-portfolio
fleet -> log-portfolio

# service mapping: blue elbow connectors share one bus; per the deck XML only
# ERP Prod maps to all three application CIs, Finance Prod and Transportation
# Mgmt map to Fiori, Transport Mgmt Prod has none
erp-prod -> fiori
erp-prod -> backend
erp-prod -> hana
finance-prod -> fiori
tm-prod -> fiori
fiori -> front-end
backend -> back-end : Runs On
hana -> db-servers
front-end -> network-gear
db-servers -> storage

# SAP Administration "Contains" is one connector glued to Transportation Mgmt
# that runs behind all four instance boxes; read as containing all four
sap-admin -> erp-prod
sap-admin -> transport-prod
sap-admin -> finance-prod
sap-admin -> tm-prod
sap-admin -> app-mgmt
various-offerings -> groups
groups -> network-gear
groups -> front-end
groups -> back-end
groups -> db-servers
groups -> storage
various-offerings -> various-tms
# dashed References: App Mgmt joins Various TMS's line, which runs to Technology
app-mgmt -> tech-portfolio
various-tms -> tech-portfolio
